      "message": "This used to be LinkLayerPacketView\nwhich was used to determine if PacketType::RSSI_WRAPPER\n\nWondering whether the packet could be converted to shared packet_view in PhyDevice Send() rather than Receive(). That way filtering of RSSI_WRAPPER does no extra work for non RSSI packets.\n\nIf PhyDevice Receive accepts shared packet_view then it can be the original or\nrewritten with new rssi.",
